{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d8f3bb311750faef1c5011310f56198b.poster.avif?t=1771624422\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d8f3bb311750faef1c5011310f56198b.webm?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d8f3bb311750faef1c5011310f56198b.mp4?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>LIST</strong> \u25b6 Steal everything on it! The list can have anything on it \u2014 play it by ear.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/312626d1e1671ba4461cc93a8fd744d6.poster.avif?t=1771624422\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/312626d1e1671ba4461cc93a8fd744d6.webm?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/312626d1e1671ba4461cc93a8fd744d6.mp4?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>WORLD</strong> \u25b6 Empty bank vaults, sneak into government buildings, look for gang caches and don't forget the other areas. Every place is an opportunity to hit it rich here.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/020823f448dd2eb2f19fc41208516dad.poster.avif?t=1771624422\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/020823f448dd2eb2f19fc41208516dad.webm?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/020823f448dd2eb2f19fc41208516dad.mp4?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>PHYSICS</strong> \u25b6 Build a pyramid of junk to climb into a hard-to-access area, or just trash everything around. Why not? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d89fae6a773172bb2efed5e6f4f54d34.poster.avif?t=1771624422\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d89fae6a773172bb2efed5e6f4f54d34.webm?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/d89fae6a773172bb2efed5e6f4f54d34.mp4?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>INTERACTIVITY</strong> \u25b6 Do you want to steal access codes and carefully disarm security systems, or take a bomb on the job and show the cops a good time? Your call.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/388bc2d813036df20664766c4f2657ee.poster.avif?t=1771624422\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/388bc2d813036df20664766c4f2657ee.webm?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837730/extras/388bc2d813036df20664766c4f2657ee.mp4?t=1771624422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>LEVELING UP</strong> \u25b6 Become a master thief \u2014 unlock the toughest robberies and pull them off using incredible equipment. And don't forget to buy a house!<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">